{"text":"There, in my little office, I read hastily scribbled letters smuggled out of totalitarian regimes by men and women who were risking imprisonment to inform the outside world of what was happening to them. I saw photographs of those who had disappeared without trace, sent to amnesty by their desperate families and friends. I read the testimony of torture victims and saw pictures of their injuries. I opened handwritten, eye-witness accounts of summary trials and executions of kidnappings and rapes. Many of my co-workers were ex-political prisoners, people who had been displaced from their homes or fled into exile because they had the temerity to speak against their governments. Visitors to our offices included those who had come to give information or to try and find out what had happened to those who they had left behind.","words":[{"text":"There","start":0.0,"end":0.98,"punct":","},{"text":"in","start":1.12,"end":1.14},{"text":"my","start":1.14,"end":1.28},{"text":"little","start":1.28,"end":1.5},{"text":"office","start":1.5,"end":1.88,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":2.48,"end":2.66},{"text":"read","start":2.66,"end":2.9},{"text":"hastily","start":2.9,"end":3.42},{"text":"scribbled","start":3.42,"end":4.02},{"text":"letters","start":4.02,"end":4.56},{"text":"smuggled","start":4.56,"end":5.2},{"text":"out","start":5.2,"end":5.78},{"text":"of","start":5.78,"end":5.92},{"text":"totalitarian","start":5.92,"end":6.6},{"text":"regimes","start":6.6,"end":7.36},{"text":"by","start":7.36,"end":8.1},{"text":"men","start":8.1,"end":8.32},{"text":"and","start":8.32,"end":8.44},{"text":"women","start":8.44,"end":8.7},{"text":"who","start":8.7,"end":8.96},{"text":"were","start":8.96,"end":9.06},{"text":"risking","start":9.06,"end":9.4},{"text":"imprisonment","start":9.4,"end":10.12},{"text":"to","start":10.12,"end":10.58},{"text":"inform","start":10.58,"end":10.9},{"text":"the","start":10.9,"end":11.06},{"text":"outside","start":11.06,"end":11.44},{"text":"world","start"